{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"y":0.05232558110168728,"x":0.71453287409859112,"w":0.20069203694661464,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"c":1,"w":0.63852071126302079,"x":0.23351616902765016,"t":"and fitting into real professions). The final paragraph presents the drawbacks,","y":0.098665202624768522,"h":0.020543469508433332},{"y":0.11727476712279183,"t":"although the main disadvantage mentioned is the inability of all universities to","w":0.64371663411458335,"c":1,"h":0.020822541041337517,"x":0.23350087296889246},{"h":0.01906419317567154,"y":0.13645906260343188,"w":0.68166091918945304,"x":0.23183390022779823,"c":1,"t":"afford these initiatives, which is not a drawback of the initiatives themselves, but in"},{"y":0.15697674425476549,"x":0.23183390841283671,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"t":"the ability to run them.","w":0.19377162933349609},{"c":1,"t":"Some of paragraph 5 is less relevant to the question [why spend time on","h":0.018985873756915961,"x":0.23356400346108291,"y":0.18159552155749448,"w":0.5968858337402343},{"c":1,"y":0.20048985301037114,"x":0.23356400469985678,"w":0.62802769978841155,"t":"something you are not that good at?]. To improve this response, there could","h":0.017533403080272181},{"w":0.63667821248372403,"h":0.018934000280872776,"c":1,"t":"be more relevant detail on the advantages of work placements and, possibly,","x":0.23356400797765559,"y":0.21798460433264266},{"x":0.233503772322152,"y":0.23466185456724997,"t":"mention of 'disadvantages' of studying abroad and work placements themselves.","w":0.66969024658203125,"h":0.022421527859879276,"c":1},{"h":0.017534420154910579,"y":0.26308139506648565,"c":1,"x":0.2335640072345018,"t":"The ideas presented are organised logically and the six paragraphs support","w":0.6211072794596354},{"y":0.28197674390238547,"w":0.66608998616536463,"t":"overall coherence. Although paragraph 3 is only one sentence, so not a standard","h":0.017533403080272292,"c":1,"x":0.23356400344730902},{"x":0.23349599187061812,"h":0.020406671634831564,"w":0.62469568888346361,"t":"paragraph but this can be seen as a stylistic variant, to make the point more","y":0.29920274747331255,"c":1},{"x":0.23356402442109886,"w":0.62629755655924479,"h":0.018984856682277451,"c":1,"y":0.31831395351621006,"t":"clearly. Cohesion is used well throughout, and the message can be followed"},{"w":0.088685995737711604,"y":0.33757759374214835,"h":0.015811264806898317,"c":1,"x":0.23174754792200844,"t":"with ease."},{"y":0.36337209273983462,"x":0.23183391043515997,"t":"Vocabulary is used well, with flexibility and precision [polishing their skills | new","w":0.65397923787434897,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1},{"y":0.38068579453769869,"x":0.23356401348134948,"t":"horizons | moving forward in that direction | future of humanity], with mostly","h":0.019023507520650296,"w":0.62975779215494787,"c":1},{"w":0.66262975056966145,"t":"accurate spelling and only a few errors in word choice [implemented these ideas","x":0.23356401739519944,"h":0.017571036844006516,"c":1,"y":0.39958012622248185},{"w":0.66089965820312502,"h":0.017572053918645025,"t":"into life | polar sides | taken as granted \/ taken for granted]. Similarly, the range","y":0.4184744579860844,"x":0.2318339078268222,"c":1},{"w":0.66262975056966145,"c":1,"x":0.23356401736337828,"y":0.43736878908150678,"t":"of grammatical structures is wide. There are frequent multi-clause sentences and","h":0.017573071660655026},{"c":1,"w":0.28065956115722657,"x":0.233405861504525,"t":"error-free sentences are frequent.","y":0.45275365395574863,"h":0.020203975466600799},{"y":0.48029662125438644,"t":"This is a good, articulate response. There are a few small lapses in vocabulary and","h":0.020058040605549055,"x":0.23179147027663854,"w":0.67312281290690112,"c":1},{"t":"grammatical structures, and more could be added on the advantages of work","x":0.23356401358950904,"y":0.49999999971795162,"w":0.63840830485026034,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1},{"w":0.32698961893717449,"x":0.23356401397282792,"t":"placements, to score even more highly.","y":0.51889433147819397,"c":1,"h":0.017494751574527623},{"y":0.95203488380875512,"t":"135","h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.88062283788252693,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1}]}